{%- comment -%}
  Auto-generated FAQs when model.faqs_json is empty.
  Params: model_name, make_name, track_size, track_count (optional)
  Wording is mirrored in hi-machine-jsonld.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="hi-mf__sec" id="faqs">
  <h2 class="hi-mf__sec-h">{{ make_name }} {{ model_name }} Rubber Track FAQs</h2>
  <p class="hi-mf__sec-sub">Fitment, sizing, availability, and shipping for {{ model_name }} tracks and undercarriage.</p>
  <div class="hi-mf__faq">
    <details open>
      <summary>What size rubber tracks fit the {{ make_name }} {{ model_name }}?</summary>
      <div class="hi-mf__faq-a">
        {%- if track_size != blank -%}
          The primary governed track configuration for this machine is <strong>{{ track_size }}</strong>.
          Some machines have more than one confirmed configuration, so use the track options linked above and match the size marking or undercarriage configuration on your machine before choosing a width or link count.
        {%- else -%}
          This machine does not have a single primary track size published on the page. Use the governed track options linked above when available, or identify the existing track size and undercarriage configuration before ordering.
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How do I know a listed track fits my {{ model_name }}?</summary>
      <div class="hi-mf__faq-a">
        Track options shown on this machine page are linked from the governed fitment catalog. If the machine has multiple confirmed configurations or a serial-number split, match the selected track size to the existing track or documented undercarriage configuration before ordering.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How fast do {{ model_name }} tracks ship?</summary>
      <div class="hi-mf__faq-a">
        Eligible in-stock orders placed before <strong>12PM CT</strong> can ship the same business day. Rubber-track orders may qualify for free LTL freight within the contiguous United States; the product and checkout determine the applicable shipping terms.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What tread patterns are available for the {{ model_name }}?</summary>
      <div class="hi-mf__faq-a">
        Available tread patterns depend on the confirmed track size and the products currently linked to this machine. Choose the correct size first, then compare the tread options and live pricing shown in the Rubber Tracks section above.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Do you sell undercarriage parts for the {{ make_name }} {{ model_name }}?</summary>
      <div class="hi-mf__faq-a">
        Sprockets, idlers, rollers, and related undercarriage components appear on this page when they are linked to the machine. For a serial-number or OEM part-number split, call <a href="tel:8508167898">(850) 816-7898</a> with the machine details.
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
